 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "Consider each sequence of vertices from Graph <i>K</i> in Figure 12.79. Determine if it is only a walk, both a walk and a path, both a walk and a trail, all three, or none of these.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 542910,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<i>n</i> → <i>q</i> → <i>o</i> → <i>p</i>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>To make sure it is a walk, check to see if the vertices are consecutive.</p>\n<p>The vertices are consecutive, so it is a walk.</p>\n<p>A trail has no repeated edges.</p>\n<p>A path has no repeated vertices.</p>\n<p>Since there are no repeated edges or vertices, this is a walk, path, and a trail.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "walk, path, and trail"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 542911,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<i>p</i> → <i>n</i> → <i>q</i> → <i>o</i> → <i>n</i> → <i>m</i>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>To make sure it is a walk, check to see if the vertices are consecutive.</p>\n<p>The vertices are consecutive, so it is a walk.</p>\n<p>A trail has no repeated edges. Draw the graph on paper. Then trace the path with another color. You will see that you have no repeated edges. This is a trail.</p>\n<p>A path has no repeated vertices. The vertex <i>n</i> is used twice, so this is not a path. This is a walk and a trail, but not a path.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "walk and a trail, but not a path"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 542912,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<i>m</i> → <i>n</i> → <i>o</i> → <i>p</i> → <i>q</i>",
   "answers": [],
